flowchart LR
    A[Business Capability] --> B[Owned Outcome]
    B --> C[Owned Data]
    C --> D[Commands]
    D --> E[Events]
    E --> F[Service Boundary]
    F --> G[APIs and Contracts]
    G --> H[Observability and Replay]

    F --> I{Boundary Healthy?}
    I -- Too Large --> J[Split by outcome/state ownership]
    I -- Too Small --> K[Merge if coordination dominates]
    I -- Clear --> L[Proceed to architecture]
